    "headline": "Paramount Skydance reports mixed second quarter as Warner deal faces March trial",
    "summary": "Paramount Skydance reported mixed second-quarter results on Tuesday, with higher streaming and studio revenue offsetting declines in television, as the company works to close its planned $110 billion acquisition of Warner Bros. ‌Discovery.  Paramount CEO David Ellison said he expects to close the merger ​with Warner Bros. even as a federal judge on Tuesday set a March trial date for an antitrust suit brought by a dozen states seeking to block the deal.  In an earnings call, Ellison said the company is \"absolutely open to finding a solution out of court, but we also really believe that we'll win at trial.\"",
    "url": "https://finance.yahoo.com/media-advertising/articles/paramount-skydance-reports-mixed-second-200812038.html",
